---
title: "The Life of a Command"
---
sequenceDiagram
    participant P as Primary Hardware (Level 1)
    participant G as Edge Gateway (OPC-UA)
    participant A as LangGraph Agent (Level 3.5)
    participant DB as Postgres (Outbox/Timescale)
    participant S as Southbound Driver

    P->>G: Telemetry (Pressure/Heartbeat)
    G->>A: MQTT Publish (UNS Path)
    Note over A: Detects Logic Drift / Predictive Failure
    A->>DB: INSERT Command (Status: PENDING)
    DB-->>S: CDC Trigger (Listen)
    S->>P: Execute Switchover Command
    P-->>S: Hardware ACK (Success)
    S->>DB: UPDATE Command (Status: COMPLETED)
    DB-->>A: Notify Success
    Note over A: Pessimistic Confirmation Received
